  <TITLE>Microbial sequencing of sludge</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>The aim of this study was to reveal the role of microaeration in enhancing anaerobic digestion and promoting the formation of large-particle sludge flocs, and to understand microbial community evolution and metabolic status under microcosmic conditions through metagenomics data.</DESCRIPTION>
